<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Sept 5-11.</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 56.00</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 59.64</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.32</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 64.40</p>
<p>   Cocoa butter...............................$152.58</p>
<p>   Residual butter............................$114.44</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>   Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 80.11</p>
<p>   Cocoa cake.................................$ 20.60</p>
<p>   Residual natural cake......................$  2.06</p>
<p>   Cocoa powder...............................$ 22.84</p>
</text>
